# Reproducing these quants

Each revision's `quantization_config.json` records its calibration (source, and the SHA-256 of the calibration file) and any non-default seed offset; `calibration.json` beside it records the calibration mix's shares and composition. The data itself is in [`traces/`](./traces) on this branch: the packed calibration rows passed to `convert.py --cal_data`, the trace they were packed from, and the eval traces behind the composite, with their sources and licenses in [`traces/DATA_NOTICE.md`](./traces/DATA_NOTICE.md). The pipeline that produced them is `quantization/quant.py` in [vllm-exl3-plugin](https://github.com/yeasah/vllm-exl3-plugin).
